@startuml domain-model
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title login - Domain model

hide empty methods
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 16

package "security (catalog: on every login)" {
  class User <<aggregate root>> {
    userID : UUID
    username
    passwordHash (BCrypt)
    role : Role
  }
  enum Role {
    ADMIN
    BACKOFFICE_OPERATOR
    ATCC
    MAINTENANCE_TECHNICIAN
    MAINTENANCE_SUPERVISOR
  }
}

User --> "1" Role

note right of User
  The JWT carries the username and the role;
  each service maps the role to its own rules
  (RBAC in its SecurityConfig).
end note
@enduml
